\
1. Student registration and login.\
2. College membership validation.\
3. Student profile management.\
4. Project creation.\
5. Project browsing and search.\
6. Project details.\
7. Project application submission.\
8. Application status tracking.\
9. Application acceptance and rejection.\
10. Team membership management.\
11. Basic in-app notifications.\
12. Basic administrative moderation.\
13. Responsive user interface.\
