19. PROJECT SUCCESS CRITERIA\
----------------------------\
\
The initial release will be considered successful when:\
\
- Students can register and access the platform.\
- Students can create and publish projects.\
- Other students can discover and search for projects.\
- Students can submit applications.\
- Project owners can accept or reject applicants.\
- Accepted applicants become team members.\
- Team capacity is enforced.\
- Users cannot perform unauthorized actions.\
- Project owners can manage recruitment.\
- Students can access their own applications and teams.\
- The application works on desktop and mobile browsers.\
- The deployed application works reliably with real test users.\
\
