20. FINAL PROJECT SUMMARY\
-------------------------\
\
ProjectCollab is a full-stack web application designed to help\
college students discover project opportunities, find teammates,\
and collaborate on academic and personal projects.\
\
The platform addresses the problem of students being unable to\
find suitable collaborators within their existing friend circles.\
\
Using React.js, JavaScript, Node.js, Express.js, and PostgreSQL,\
the application will provide student profiles, project listings,\
search and discovery, application management, team formation,\
notifications, and basic collaboration tools.\
\
The initial release will focus on a single college and the core\
project recruitment workflow.\
\
Future releases may introduce intelligent recommendations,\
team skill gap analysis, partner discovery, project portfolios,\
and additional collaboration features.\
\
The ultimate goal is to make finding the right project and the\
right teammates easier for every student.\
